Ranked by chats, ties broken by memories. Help chats and Brahma Console sessions are excluded. Participants marked \`removed\` still count — a character written out of a scene was still in it. Vault size is the store's cached total as of its last scan; because content is addressed by hash and hard-linkable across vaults, bytes shared between two characters appear in both rows.

